/T (Gap 1 - Over-Reliance on 3D Spatial Data: The vast majority of top-tier AI fluid models are trained and tested on perfect 3D point clouds. In a real hospital, raw imaging data is naturally 2D, squashed, and missing a lot of depth information. )
/E (Gap 1 - Over-Reliance on 3D Spatial Data: The vast majority of top-tier AI fluid models are trained and tested on perfect 3D point clouds. In a real hospital, raw imaging data is naturally 2D, squashed, and missing a lot of depth information. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
