/T (Gap 2 - Vulnerability to Clinical Noise: Normal neural networks tend to overfit and memorize the static \(Gaussian noise\) that is naturally present in medical scanning equipment. When you feed them noisy fluid data, their predicted pressure and velocity gradients collapse entirely. )
/E (Gap 2 - Vulnerability to Clinical Noise: Normal neural networks tend to overfit and memorize the static \(Gaussian noise\) that is naturally present in medical scanning equipment. When you feed them noisy fluid data, their predicted pressure and velocity gradients collapse entirely. )
/Pg 21 0 R
