/T (Gap 3 - The Tomographic Bottleneck: There is a glaring disconnect between the 2D hardware used to scan patients and the 3D software used to simulate their blood flow. Forcing data through tomographic reconstruction delays critical medical analysis and introduces geometric errors. )
