/T (Applying PINNs to fluid dynamics took a massive step forward with "Hidden Fluid Mechanics" \(HFM\). Raissi et al. published this framework in Science in 2020. Normal CFD needs you to define exact inlet velocities, outlet pressures, and wall boundaries. HFM avoids this completely. It uses deep learning to pull out hidden states just by looking at flow snapshots and applying the Navier-Stokes equations. )
/E (Applying PINNs to fluid dynamics took a massive step forward with "Hidden Fluid Mechanics" \(HFM\). Raissi et al. published this framework in Science in 2020. Normal CFD needs you to define exact inlet velocities, outlet pressures, and wall boundaries. HFM avoids this completely. It uses deep learning to pull out hidden states just by looking at flow snapshots and applying the Navier-Stokes equations. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
