<<
/Title (In math, we call this projection process the Forward Radon Transform. If a hospital wants to use standard CFD or HFM, they have to reverse this process. They run algorithms like Filtered Back Projection \(FBP\) or Algebraic Reconstruction Techniques \(ART\) to "un-squash" the 2D shadows back into a 3D grid. We call this Tomographic Reconstruction.)
