<<
/Title (Stochastic Batch Sizing Strategy: Normal CFD tries to compute the entire fluid volume at once, which will instantly max out standard VRAM. To fix this, we set a stochastic batch size of 5,000 spatial points per training step. This specific number balances our VRAM limit while keeping enough statistical meaning for the randomized ray-casting we introduce later.)
